25,2,1,talk,Servas,,It seems our reporting processes are strained by physical assets. Verifiable data is a luxury we should prioritize.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The data suggests that back-office financial tools are our safest bets for exits, while operational overhead is a risk.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Minako,,"Our reserves are being depleted faster than expected, and our credit line is far too restrictive regarding software.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Mio,,"We have plenty of software expertise, but finding people for physical operations is taking way too long!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Deployment delays are significant for regulated data, and hardware shortages have previously crippled our timelines.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Servas,,We must consider the burden of the audit. Physical depots add unnecessary complexity to our quarter-end.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Asuka,,I also noticed that independent practices and field-based tools show much stronger customer loyalty during price hikes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Minako,,"We need a company that doesn't demand immediate, heavy follow-on capital that we cannot borrow against.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Mio,,"If we pick a company needing field crews, we are going to be stuck in recruitment limbo for months.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Toshio,,Software that integrates with banks seems to move faster than anything involving medical records or custom hardware.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
