50,3,1,talk,Servas,,"The candidates are Clinic Scheduler, Harvest Sensor, Fabric Loop, and Ledger Bridge. I lean toward Ledger Bridge for reporting ease.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Ledger Bridge fits the exit profile, but Harvest Sensor and Clinic Scheduler have better retention. I prefer Ledger Bridge.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Minako,,Ledger Bridge is the most sustainable choice given our current credit constraints and reserve depletion.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Mio,,Fabric Loop and Harvest Sensor sound like a recruitment nightmare. I vote for Ledger Bridge!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Clinic Scheduler has too much security review risk. Harvest Sensor has hardware risks. Ledger Bridge is the logical choice.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Servas,,It is rare we agree so quickly. The simplicity of the bridge is its greatest asset.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. The risk of a write-off is lowest with a lean software tool.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Minako,,I am satisfied. It protects our remaining liquidity.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Mio,,Yay! Let's go with the one that doesn't make me call recruiters all day!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I concur.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
